 "usage_rules": {
  "R1_bos": "room `bos` only (the Ball's arena): the dressing never adds or moves a tile or a solid; the arch posts (24 px shafts with a cap and a base, cropped from the lit shaft of pier_l) stand on the gameplay posts' centres (104 and 152 on the left, 488 on the right, where the exit door's frame is the second post) and the lintels at 112 px over them; the four composer torches, their pools and the timber door are removed and two torches stand on the lintels (flames 164 px over the floor, clear of the alcoves, the lane and the weight); the copper run (rule C) stands in the left alcove between the gate and the post; the two magenta tubes are the limited UV",
  "R2_presenter_pieces": "the weight, its chains and the open stairwell are drawn by the scene's presenter at the sim rects; they are not placed"
 }
